text I enter Sunohara's room to find him still sleeping in his futon.
text @[Tomoya]
text Wake up, Sunohara. You have a visitor. I'm here.
text All I get in reply are the snores of a guy, who when sleeping, sounds like that of a domestic truffle hog sniffing out a prized patch of mushroom-y goodness. He's sound asleep.
text He probably just went to bed late again.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm gonna play a prank on you if you don't get up!
text ......
text I can hear lively voices coming from the hallway.
text It sounds like some rugby club idiots on their way to practice.
text Sunohara's clothes are stacked in a mountain on his floor. I take some and tie sleeve to sleeve.
text I then tie one end to Sunohara's foot.
text After that, I take the other with me out into the hallway.
