text One rugby team member from next door is just leaving as I do.
text @[Tomoya]
text Hey.
text I speak to him.
sound X0.aac
text @[Rugby Player]
text What?
text @[Tomoya]
text Let's play tug of war.
sound X1.aac
text @[Rugby Player]
text Tug of war?
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah. You'll be up against Sunohara. He said he wanted to have a manly battle against you.
sound X2.aac
text @[Rugby Player]
text A battle of strength...? He's got some pretty big balls deciding to take me on.
sound X3.aac
text @[Rugby Player]
text All right, it'll be a good warm-up before practice. I accept.
text @[Tomoya]
text Okay, here you go.
text I have him hold the cuff of the clothes, used in place of a rope.
sound X4.aac
text @[Rugby Player]
text Okay, whenever you're ready.
text The clothes trail off into Sunohara's room.
text @[Tomoya]
text Okay, Sunohara's all ready too. Here we go.
text @[Tomoya]
text On your mark, get set...
text @[Tomoya]
text Go!
sound X5.aac
text @[Rugby Player]
text URRRYAAAAGH!
text The rugby player runs down the hall like a complete maniac.
text Trailing behind him...
sound X6.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text HYAAAAAAAAGHH!!
text ...is Sunohara, face-up and sliding across the floor, looking like a cross between shock and "I'm going to kill you" fury.
